
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Astrid.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Astrid.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"17e3dit","at":1777331817827},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777149395413,"size":3946,"at":1777331817894,"hash":"17e3dit"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,16],"#Characters - Astrid":[18,35],"#Characters - Astrid#{1}":[20,28],"#Characters - Astrid#{2}":[29,29],"#Characters - Astrid#{3}":[30,30],"#Characters - Astrid#{4}":[31,31],"#Characters - Astrid#{5}":[32,33],"#Characters - Astrid#{6}":[34,35]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":35,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Astrid","Enforcer"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**What is this?**  \nEntry for Astrid, the \"Broken Doll\" — Loren Claymore's Handmaiden and Enforcer. A trauma-distorted Floran Human with a damaged Ego, complete Superego replacement by Loren's will, and obsessive foot fetishism as psychological displacement.\n\n**When to select:**  \nSelect when the user is in Loren Claymore's orbit; when interacting with a cold, socially inept enforcer who speaks curtly, moves stiffly in social settings, or acts bizarrely; when scenes involve trauma, obsessive devotion, or foot-related fetish content. Also select during missions where ruthless efficiency is displayed.\n\n**Key relationships:**  \n- **Loren Claymore:** Her absolute master. Loren's will = Astrid's morality. Astrid owes her life and freedom to Loren.\n- **Vanessa (contrast):** Self-aware zealot. Astrid is her broken, non-self-aware counterpart.\n- **ISFJ (trauma-distorted):** Introverted, observant, fanatically loyal — but social functions severely underdeveloped."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Astrid.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"v22ji4","at":1777331817827},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Astrid.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,16],"size":1152,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
